@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title COLORS | Use Case Diagram
left to right direction

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 12
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam actorBorderColor #334155
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam usecaseBorderColor #2563EB
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #334155
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFBEB
skinparam noteBorderColor #D97706

actor User

rectangle "COLORS web application" {
  usecase "Log in" as Login
  usecase "Add a color" as Add
  usecase "Search saved colors" as Search
  usecase "Log out" as Logout
}

User -- Login
User -- Add
User -- Search
User -- Logout

note right of Login
  Enter an existing username and password.
  A successful login saves a browser cookie
  and opens color.html.
end note

note right of Add
  Save the entered name with the userId
  supplied by the browser.
end note

note right of Search
  Search names using SQL LIKE and the
  supplied userId; display matching names.
end note

note right of Logout
  Clear browser user state, expire the
  cookie, and return to index.html.
end note

legend bottom
  Add, search, and log out are on color.html.
  The page reads the cookie and redirects if userId < 0.
  The PHP color endpoints trust the submitted userId.
  Login is a prerequisite in normal use, not an included call on every action.
endlegend
@enduml
